# parse-grpc-frame-header round-trip: build a frame for "hello" then parse
# the header. Expected: compressed=false, length=5, header-len=5.

[include %libdir "protocols/grpc.llt"]
---
[call [fn [frame]
    [call %.parse-grpc-frame-header [str-slice 0 5 frame]]]
    [call %.build-grpc-frame "hello" false]]
=== error
[E099] syntax error at 6:59 (cannot evaluate error node) (defined at 6:59-6:60)

=== warn
syntax error at 6:59 (cannot typecheck error node) at 6:59-6:60
